t":"悸，動也。俞樾說。","fullText":"悸，動也。俞樾說。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-006"]},{"id":"quwanli-quanshi:0009-1:part-1","annotationId":"0009","glossId":"0009-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/060-wan-lan/quwanli-quanshi/0009-1","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","materialTitle":"詩經詮釋","contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","publicationYear":1983,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"童子佩韘","sourceLabel":"第 77 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注釋","excerpt":"韘，音攝，玦也，以象骨爲之，著大拇指（猶今之搬指），射時用以鉤弦，使指不痛。","fullText":"韘，音攝，玦也，以象骨爲之，著大拇指（猶今之搬指），射時用以鉤弦，使指不痛。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-008"]},{"id":"quwanli-quanshi:0010-1:part-1","annotationId":"0010","glossId":"0010-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/060-wan-lan/quwanli-quanshi/0010-1","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","materialTitle":"詩經詮釋","contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","publicationYear":1983,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"能不我甲","sourceLabel":"第 77 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注釋","excerpt":"甲，狎也。","fullText":"甲，狎也。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-010"]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/060-wan-lan/wangli-yundu/0001-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"芄兰之支，童子佩觿，虽则佩觿，能不我知，容兮遂兮，垂带悸兮。","sourceLabel":"第 173 页局部","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","excerpt":"芄兰之支(tjie)，童子佩觿(hyue)。虽则佩觿(hyue)，能不我知(tie)?（支部）容兮遂(ziuat)兮，垂带悸(giuet)兮!（物质合韵）","fullText":"芄兰之支(tjie)，童子佩觿(hyue)。虽则佩觿(hyue)，能不我知(tie)?（支部）容兮遂(ziuat)兮，垂带悸(giuet)兮!（物质合韵）","notes":"据页图转写，保留拟音与韵部。","partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006"]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/060-wan-lan/wangli-yundu/0002-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"芄兰之叶，童子佩韘，虽则佩韘，能不我甲，容兮遂兮，垂带悸兮。","sourceLabel":"第 174 页局部","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","excerpt":"芄兰之叶(jiap)，童子佩韘(sjiap)。虽则佩韘(sjiap)，能不我甲(keap)?（盍部）容兮遂(ziuat)兮，垂带悸(giuet)兮!（质物合韵）","fullText":"芄兰之叶(jiap)，童子佩韘(sjiap)。虽则佩韘(sjiap)，能不我甲(keap)?（盍部）容兮遂(ziuat)兮，垂带悸(giuet)兮!（质物合韵）","notes":"据页图转写，保留拟音与韵部。","partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/060-wan-lan/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"芄蘭之支，童子佩觿，雖則佩觿，能不我知，容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮。芄蘭之葉，童子佩韘，雖則佩韘，能不我甲，容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"朱熹解《芄蘭》时，先释“觿”为成人解结之佩、“韘”为右手钩弦之具，","fullText":"朱熹解《芄蘭》时，先释“觿”为成人解结之佩、“韘”为右手钩弦之具，又以“能不我知”“能不我甲”都归为讥刺童子才能不足而自以为能，至于“容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮”则仅见其舒缓放肆之外仪。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":["seg-002:4-4:觿","seg-008:4-4:韘"],"glossAnchorIds":["anchor-1-1","anchor-1-2"],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0001-1:part-2","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/060-wan-lan/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"芄蘭之支，童子佩觿，雖則佩觿，能不我知，容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮。芄蘭之葉，童子佩韘，雖則佩韘，能不我甲，容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"又以“能不我知”“能不我甲”都归为讥刺童子才能不足而自以为能，","fullText":"朱熹解《芄蘭》时，先释“觿”为成人解结之佩、“韘”为右手钩弦之具，又以“能不我知”“能不我甲”都归为讥刺童子才能不足而自以为能，至于“容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮”则仅见其舒缓放肆之外仪。","notes":null,"partOrder":2,"anchorIds":["seg-004:1-4:能不我知","seg-010:1-4:能不我甲"],"glossAnchorIds":["anchor-2-1","anchor-2-2"],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0001-1:part-3","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/060-wan-lan/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"芄蘭之支，童子佩觿，雖則佩觿，能不我知，容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮。芄蘭之葉，童子佩韘，雖則佩韘，能不我甲，容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"至于“容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮”则仅见其舒缓放肆之外仪。","fullText":"朱熹解《芄蘭》时，先释“觿”为成人解结之佩、“韘”为右手钩弦之具，又以“能不我知”“能不我甲”都归为讥刺童子才能不足而自以为能，至于“容兮遂兮，垂帶悸兮”则仅见其舒缓放肆之外仪。","notes":null,"partOrder":3,"anchorIds":["seg-005:1-4:容兮遂兮","seg-006:1-4:垂帶悸兮"],"glossAnchorIds":["anchor-3-1","anchor-3-2"],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]}]}}}
